This directory vendors the reference C++ implementation of "Let's Be Rational" by
Peter Jäckel (www.jaeckel.org/LetsBeRational.7z), under the notice below, which is
preserved here as the licence requires. The algorithm is described in "Let's Be
Rational", Peter Jäckel, Wilmott, pp 40-53, January 2015.

Vendored, unmodified except for one portability rename recorded in PATCH-NOTES.txt:
  erf_cody.cpp, lets_be_rational.cpp(.h), normaldistribution.cpp(.h),
  rationalcubic.cpp(.h), dllmain.h
Our own file (not Jäckel's): lbr_batch.cpp — the batch entry point.

